Z||000001||TheFiero64||07-11-2000||05:11 PM||||I have little round spot mirrors on all my cars. They are about 1 inch in diameter and are panoramic. They sell them at <B>wal-mart</B>. They are called <B>hot spots</B>. I placed them on the outside edge of my mirrors. They have eliminated all of my blind spots<P>------------------<BR>Joshua Bumpus<BR>New Bedford, MA<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fi.jpg"> ||||reg||10
