Z||000005||Philphine||07-12-2000||02:18 AM||||got kawasaki ninja cycle mirrors on my '87 a pillars, but i can't really recommend them. if you like that idea you would be better off looking for something that screws down into the a pillar. mine were ment to be mounted from the bottom, i drilled them out. also look for something light weight cause the areas not that strong.<P>i really wanted honda cbr blackbird mirrors, they have turn signals in them, but the cost could make you cry.<p>[This message has been edited by Philphine (edited 07-12-2000).]||||reg||1
